@segment  return-methods
@title    The Two Ways Back
@levels   F10
@duration ~1m30s

say Before we begin the climb, know this.
pause 3
say You are always in control. You can return to full waking consciousness at any time, by either of two methods.
pause 5
say The first is immediate. Simply think the number one in your mind. When you do, you will return. Fully awake, both physically and mentally. Clear. Alert. Present.
pause 6
say The second is gradual. From whatever focus level you find yourself in, count slowly backwards in your mind down to one. This is the graceful return, and it allows you to descend through each state in turn, settling gently back into your body.
pause 5
say Both methods are always available to you. Carry this knowing with you as we climb.
pause 6
